📗
  🚑 What becomes of an error. A handler or a layer of middleware that raises
  is answered for here, at the call that raised, so an error never travels:
  the layers outside are handed a response like any other. There is no safe
  way to pass an error on in this compiler (🔺 puts objects on the stack), so
  nothing here does.
