  📗
    The response for *error*, which was raised while *request* was being
    answered. The mappers are asked in the order they were added, and the
    first response one of them gives is the answer. When none gives one, an
    error that carries a problem becomes that problem's response, and any
    other is unexpected: it is logged, and answered with a 500 that says what
    it was only when app.environment is Development.
